{"id":"786c9edad998bcfe","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-universal-effective-martingale.md","title":"成功集通用的有效鞅存在","display":"thm-universal-effective-martingale — 成功集通用的有效鞅存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-universal-effective-martingale","aliases":["43-thm-universal-effective-martingale"],"display":"thm-universal-effective-martingale — 成功集通用的有效鞅存在","depends_on":["[[43-df-effective-martingale]]","[[43-df-covers]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.1.1 Corollary 10.1.6，印刷207，PDF227","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-universal-effective-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-universal-effective-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal-effective-martingale — 成功集通用的有效鞅存在"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.1 Corollary 10.1.6，印刷207，PDF227"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,g\">\\(d,g\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；有效鞅与成功见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Covers}\">\\(\\mathrm{Covers}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\">\\((2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\land\\forall g\\;\\forall X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(g)\\land\\mathrm{Covers}(g,X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\land\\forall g\\;\\forall X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(g)\\land\\mathrm{Covers}(g,X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将通用ML检验转为有效鞅；成功集通用不等于在每个有限串上乘法支配。原书Corollary中“all martingales”须按有效鞅语境限制。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.1 Corollary 10.1.6，印刷207，PDF227。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effective-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-covers","status":"resolved","id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-covers]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d,g$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；有效鞅与成功见 [[43-df-effective-martingale]]、[[43-df-covers]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-covers","status":"resolved","id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d,g$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；有效鞅与成功见 [[43-df-effective-martingale]]、[[43-df-covers]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-covers","status":"resolved","id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Covers}$ 是 $(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega$ 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，见 [[43-df-covers]]。\n$\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}$ 是函数 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-effective-martingale]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Covers}$ 是 $(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega$ 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，见 [[43-df-covers]]。\n$\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}$ 是函数 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-effective-martingale]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d,g","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Covers}","display":false},{"tex":"(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(d)\\land\\forall g\\;\\forall X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveMartingale}(g)\\land\\mathrm{Covers}(g,X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1615,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-universal-effective-martingale]] — 成功集通用的有效鞅存在"}],"outgoing":["ca2fbe2bdf667589","b31a1edfb1ee2862"]}